; Tradie RUN G - REAL ORDERS, D-20 zone entry, D-08 enforced
; Everything matches 04-zone-entry.set except InpDryRun.
; RUN D measured 39 signals / 5y (7.8 per year) but 13 of those used only one
; of OB/FVG, which D-08 does not allow. With InpZoneRequireOBFVG=true expect
; ~26 fills instead. Deliberate: that is the ratified rule.
;
; Settings tab changes for this run:
;   Modelling = Every tick based on real ticks   (exits now matter)
;   Delays    = Random delay
; Everything else on Settings stays as for RUN D.
; 
